nate", "stance": -1, "head": "Leaning against Schumer", "text": "Has said she would oppose Schumer, though some reports say she avoids a clear stance.", "source": "NBC News", "url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/newly-elected-senate-democrats-spotlight-politics-desk-rcna609239", "kind": "seed"}, {"date": "2026-11-14", "memberId": "sen-annie-andrews", "name": "Annie Andrews", "where": "SC", "chamber": "senate", "stance": -1, "head": "Leaning against Schumer", "text": "Wants generational change and has said she'd oppose Schumer.", "source": "NBC News", "url": "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/newly-elected-senate-democrats-spotlight-politics-desk-rcna609239", "kind": "seed"}, {"date": "2026-11-14", "memberId": "sen-raphael-warnock", "name": "Raphael Warnock", "where": "GA", "chamber": "senate", "stance": 0, "head": "Undecided", "text": "Won't commit. Says Democrats are at an inflection point.", "source": "Al Jazeera / CNN", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/11/14/why-us-democrats-are-expected-to-keep-schumer-and-jeffries-in-power", "kind": "seed"}, {"date": "2026-11-14", "memberId": "hse-alexandria-ocasio-cortez", "name": "Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez", "where": "NY-14", "chamber": "house", "stance": 2, "head": "Declared for Jeffries", "text": "Asked whether she backs Jeffries, said yes, noting the race is unopposed.", "source": "Al Jazeera / CNN", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/11/14/why-us-democrats-are-expected-to-keep-schumer-and-jeffries-in-power", "kind": "seed"}, {"date": "2026-11-14", "memberId": "hse-glenn-ivey", "name": "Glenn Ivey", "where": "MD-4", "chamber": "house", "stance": 2, "head": "Declared for Jeffries", "text": "", "source": "Capital News Service", "url": "https://primarydemocrats.com/leadership.html", "kind": "seed"}, {"date": "2026-11-14", "memberId": "hse-zack-mullock", "name": "Zack Mullock", "where": "NJ-2", "chamber": "house", "stance": 2, "head": "Declared for Jeffries", 